                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 1088.—Extract]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Act of March</hi> 3, 1885.</head>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sec</hi>. 2. That the President he, and he is hereby,
                    authorized to return the Arctic steamer Alert to Her Majesty’s Government, with
                    the thanks of the Government of the United States for the generous and graceful
                    act of courtesy in so promptly tendering the gift of that vessel, and for the
                    valuable service thereby rendered to the cause of science and humanity.</p>
            </div>
